The authors have thoroughly addressed all concerns raised in the first round of review. The revised manuscript is substantially improved in terms of theoretical grounding, protocol consistency, experimental validation, and presentation clarity. The paper is now technically sound, well-validated, and suitable for publication.
Response: We sincerely thank the reviewer for the positive assessment of the revised manuscript. We greatly appreciate the reviewer’s careful evaluation and constructive comments throughout the review process, which have helped us strengthen the theoretical analysis, protocol consistency, experimental validation, and overall presentation of the manuscript.
